{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52554","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏母咸亨奉勅文，府兵云衆成营屯。\n屹然一镇云霄末，渐尔羣言花柳春。\n男生女长通蕃息，五十八氏交爲婚。\n火田黄稻俱甘旨，纲水金鱼洽醉。\n寇戎不测纷如雪，甲胄何时不出门。\n夜祀天皇弘德泽，日将山獠化缟民。\n一声谯鼓月初出，戍楼西北望皇阍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}